# Menu entries hidden from the launcher: not useful to start directly, or duplicates.
# The apps stay installed and still work as file and link handlers. One desktop file
# name per line, then "# why".
footclient.desktop            # Foot again, in client mode for a running Foot server
foot-server.desktop           # Foot again, as a background server
pcmanfm-desktop-pref.desktop  # PCManFM's desktop-icons mode, which limde doesn't use
info.desktop                  # TeXInfo, a terminal manual reader that duplicates man
